# CLAUDE.md — subfrost-mobile

> Drop this file at the root of `subfrost-mobile` to pull in the subfrost-ops domain pack.

Cross-platform wallet. Android Compose + iOS SwiftUI shells over a shared Rust core via uniffi. Hardware-backed key wrap (StrongBox / Secure Enclave). Hyflaria-tunneled RPC.

