## Build sequence (canonical, do not skip)
```bash
# Release .so per ABI (shipped in APK)
cargo ndk -t arm64-v8a --platform 29 build --release -p subfrost-mobile-ffi --lib
cargo ndk -t x86_64 --platform 29 build --release -p subfrost-mobile-ffi --lib

# DEBUG .so for bindgen (NOT shipped — has metadata)
cargo build -p subfrost-mobile-ffi --lib

# Regenerate Kotlin from DEBUG .so
cargo run --release --bin uniffi-bindgen -- generate \
    --library target/debug/libsubfrost_mobile_ffi.so \
    --language kotlin --out-dir android-compose/app/src/main/java/

# Run the in-sync test
cargo test -p subfrost-mobile-ffi --test uniffi_bindings_in_sync
```

